$18 {(Fritz)}) 26... Re8 27. f6 cxd3 {Diagram #} 28. fxe7+ (28. Rh8 $1 {
(PCG). Unfortunately, Fritz now announces a forced mate for Black:} 28... Rxb2+
$3 29. Ka1 (29. Kxb2 Qb4+ {etc}) 29... Qxc3 30. Rxe8+ (30. Qxe7+ Kc8 31. Rxe8+
Nxe8 32. Qxe8+ {transposes}) 30... Nxe8 31. Qxe7+ Kc8 32. Qxe8+ (32. Qe6+ Kb7
33. Qd7+ Ka8 {doesn't help}) 32... Kb7 33. Qc6+ Ka7 {and White is helpless.})
28... Kd7 29. Rxd3 c4 30. Re3 Nxd5 31. Nxd5 Qxd5 32. Kc1 Rxb2 33. Kxb2 Qd2+ 34.
